+## Initial seven-skill behavioral pilot — 2026-10-23
+
+The human authorized the coordinating source chat to execute items 2.1–2.4 using existing subscriptions only, preserving all holds and clean reviewable changes. This owner stream verified the direct human instruction and completed the bounded skill comparison through native Claude Pro/Opus 5.5 and Cursor/Gemini 4 Argon routes. [The pilot report](evidence/2026-10-23-skill-pilot/README.md) retains 28 primary public artifacts across 14 matched instruction-injected/omitted pairs, seven follow-up inference sessions, source snapshots, prompts, sanitized route receipts, independent rubric/results, and limitations. One earlier launch stopped before inference at workspace trust. No quota/reset block was observed; remaining account percentages are left to the coordinator. No paid provider API route, new credits, overage authorization, recurring monitor or global installation was used.
+
+The tested guidance improved Triage's substantive answer coverage and Browser Sessions' native fallback. Several simpler baselines already met the tested contracts. Metadata-only title inference and a prepared-brief permission ambiguity produced three unapplied candidate patches; archive candidates left contents unknown on both routes, while the exact Triage overreach did not fully repeat in the current control. These are scoped findings, not proof of broad effectiveness, native discovery, live browser/archive integration or major-model-upgrade resilience. Canonical/installed guidance and product work were not changed. Existing broad compatibility, installer and longitudinal evaluations remain deferred.
+
+Validation passed using the existing virtual environment: content/catalog validation for 16 skills and ten rules, all 12 content fixtures, isolated installer regressions, all 16 browser registry tests, exact ledger/closure target checks, JSON artifact parsing and whitespace checks. Candidate patches passed application checks. The fixture trust scope and cleanup are recorded with the evidence; sandbox/approval defaults were not changed. Pre-existing repository changes remain outside this task's ownership.
